    contents of this experiment are not intended to insult or offend. Please do not
    take anything personally.\n\n\n\n3. Note: The contents of this experiment are
    highly classified. Do not share any classified materials with personnel who do
    not have proper security clearance.\n\n\n\n4. Note: Only one person is permitted
    to undertake this experiment at a time. Do not contaminate results.\n\n\n\n5.
    Note: I\u2122 SYSTEM INTERFACE reserves the right of final interpretation for
    this experiment."
